0110: what drivers/core/hakios.version.c needs on this base: sys/hakios.version.h (as the xnu-8796 series has it), the kern.hakios
sysctl node (bsd/dev/hakios.base.c, until drivers/core/hakios.platform.c builds here) and the call in bsd_init().
Scion's change to Apple's xnu, under the APSL 2.0.

